[11.65, "o", "Spectio 0.0.1 is running on demo-hpc-login1, port 18092.\r\n"]
[11.69, "o", "Open this link in a browser on this machine (single use, valid 15 minutes):\r\n"]
[11.73, "o", "   http://127.0.0.1:18092/auth/link#<ticket>\r\n"]
[11.77, "o", "New link at any time: spectio login --print-link\r\n"]
[11.81, "o", "Spectio never asks you to paste a link.\r\n"]
[11.85, "o", "The server runs in tmux session spectio-server: `tmux attach -t spectio-server` shows it, `tmux kill-session -t spectio-server` stops it.\r\n"]
[11.89, "o", "exit 0\r\n"]
